brigaxsir (Rust port)
=====================

This crate is a Rust port of Mojang's Brigadier:
https://github.com/Mojang/brigadier

Brigadier is Copyright (c) Mojang AB and is licensed under the MIT License.

The initial module layout, public API shape and a substantial part of the
implementation in this crate are adapted from azalea-brigadier:

    azalea-brigadier
    https://github.com/azalea-rs/azalea/tree/main/azalea-brigadier
    Copyright (c) 2022 mat
    Licensed under the MIT License

Changes made for this crate: the package and imports are named `brigaxsir`,
the `azalea-buf`, `azalea-chat` and `bevy_*` dependencies and the
corresponding feature were removed, `parking_lot` is pinned to 0.11, and tests
and documentation were adjusted. Behaviour that differs from the Java original
is documented in `notes.md` at the repository root.
